grid 1.1 s E4+B4 X.gx..x.g.xg..xg|x.gx..x.g.Xg.gx. len=3
track c2
# guitar: a short chank on 2 and 4 (3rd, 7th, 9th), a scratch before the 4
grid 1.1 s E4+B4+D5 ....X......gX...|....X......gX..g len=4

